<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-19T22:32:07.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has deployed drones against civilian targets, striking a livestock market in Khartoum and a site in West Kordofan that killed civilians, while Rapid Support Forces drones have hit an artisanal gold mine in South Kordofan and a gold-mining area on the Egypt border, causing civilian casualties. Drone attacks have also hit markets in Khartoum and southern Sudan, killing dozens of civilians. These strikes expand the use of drones from combatant targets to economic and civilian sites. The conflict continues between the Sudanese Armed Forces and the Rapid Support Forces. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20261019-drone-attack-near-southern-sudan-market-kills-scores&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBzZzcyUzRkTzRDQmVoMzRubDI1T19wakJySDZmejIxeHhhRGJyZC1RYVZ2MUVGYnJzWURzSjJLNTU5cTF3V2lXZVNoUEEyMlFqYTYtcm1RWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNVnRGWlhjWjFwQzdtaXg3eHJvLXpMeDE4cFduNmRYVTJmcGs3SnktM2VOX184a0V5MHBEa1FvNGZ0SjBjNzBlM2JMX1FIekotSnhmaVN3dFQtcUd2N0hNVm5VZmNac2ZjSUk5Y1p5by1pYjFIb2c0RVFCRERELWRuVktnUFZHNjc1R01aX2FvQjVsVkVDNVhJRU5R?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPTHhueUhjNUJEakFqYmkwWkM3XzhmcTV1dHQyckxjNzZOT000WHNRa2djbGI0dWFiRWRqZ2t3N3VOQm9JeXZUaHdkaU5ZbUd1eGJ6dU9tWWotaXhxVExGeklLckdMWUl0dHpZTDYzZzdDNk9JamdvRE1PTnY2Tm44MjZaZ203YlZlY3ZiU3VlZXRBXzQx?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&l